WEBVTT

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:27.209
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.589
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:30.004 --> 00:00:33.844
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.889 --> 00:00:36.216
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.993 --> 00:00:48.969
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:50.965
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:55.511
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:56.092 --> 00:00:58.728
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.729 --> 00:01:00.879
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:04.138
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:04.168 --> 00:01:08.300
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:12.619
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.631 --> 00:01:14.931
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:19.645
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.671 --> 00:01:22.071
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:22.072 --> 00:01:25.120
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:25.121 --> 00:01:27.744
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.745 --> 00:01:29.339
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.858
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.859 --> 00:01:34.980
♪ Shine bright like it's
the end of the world ♪

00:01:35.058 --> 00:01:37.526
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.410
♪ You hands are now ♪

00:01:39.411 --> 00:01:40.944
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:44.983
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:46.228 --> 00:01:50.196
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:53.664
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:10.214 --> 00:02:11.681
Don't tell anyone what happened!

00:02:16.658 --> 00:02:19.117
You know, I will take
on the responsibility.

00:02:20.554 --> 00:02:22.981
An agent of Holy Court will
have two passes for man-slaughter.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.260
Do you need me to waste
one of that pass on you?

00:02:48.482 --> 00:02:49.708
Forget it.

00:02:49.804 --> 00:02:51.005
I will keep it a secret.

00:02:51.152 --> 00:02:54.111
I am going back tonight.
Next time I am in Song City,

00:02:54.205 --> 00:02:56.885
I wish I could have the pleasure
of having a coffee with you.

00:02:59.606 --> 00:03:01.529
You want to talk about
the second awakening,

00:03:01.569 --> 00:03:02.913
but too embarrassed to ask?

00:03:07.676 --> 00:03:11.176
Don't rely on the Book of Starchart
if you want to increase your strength.

00:03:12.071 --> 00:03:15.044
The more you use the books,
the harder you're to control your Stars.

00:03:15.485 --> 00:03:17.607
The side effect will
too steep a price to pay.

00:03:18.289 --> 00:03:20.724
With the progress of your leveling-up now,

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:22.643
there is a chance of advancing
to higher level.

00:03:27.264 --> 00:03:29.693
Right now, I need to gain
control of my Starchart.

00:03:29.734 --> 00:03:31.374
I should meditate in home,

00:03:31.422 --> 00:03:33.262
I can attend the university
after my training is done,

00:03:33.551 --> 00:03:35.923
so I will have more time to try new things.

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:40.168
I made a promise to help
with your second awakening,

00:03:40.263 --> 00:03:41.394
I won't break my promise.

00:03:42.295 --> 00:03:43.655
I have made a call.

00:03:43.722 --> 00:03:45.089
you just go there yourself.

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:47.487
Miss Tang Yue,
how honourable of you.

00:03:49.167 --> 00:03:52.292
Mingzhu Tower becomes the base  of
Association of Magical Societies in this world?

00:03:52.867 --> 00:03:53.894
That is amazing.

00:03:59.161 --> 00:04:00.974
Excuse me, make some room for me.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:12.911
How may I help you,
my honourable mage?

00:04:13.836 --> 00:04:14.716
I am here for the awakening.

00:04:14.862 --> 00:04:17.118
Someone made an appointment for me.
I am Mo Fan.

00:04:17.745 --> 00:04:19.198
Okay, Mr. Mo Fan.

00:04:19.346 --> 00:04:21.168
The Awakening Room is right here.
Please this way.

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:25.834
Association of Magical Societies is
the most powerful organization.

00:04:26.048 --> 00:04:28.968
All mages must obey
the laws of the Association.

00:04:29.221 --> 00:04:32.630
All mages that made it to Nebula level
will have face-to-face services.

00:04:32.997 --> 00:04:36.783
The services we provide include
item trade and bounty rewards.

00:04:37.171 --> 00:04:40.877
The process saves a lot of time
and trifles for the customers.

00:04:42.513 --> 00:04:43.326
Mr. Guo.

00:04:43.726 --> 00:04:45.579
The man who needs awakening is here.

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:47.809
Let him take a seat over there.

00:04:48.358 --> 00:04:50.642
Mian, is the Crystal Ball ready?

00:04:50.756 --> 00:04:53.450
-Which Invigorating Stone should we use?
-Thunder Talent.

00:04:54.947 --> 00:04:56.254
Should you not inquire the customer?

00:04:56.334 --> 00:04:58.682
I despise brat with privilege
that learns nothing in life.

00:04:58.997 --> 00:05:00.903
He thinks he could learn
Thunder Talent just by using money.

00:05:01.438 --> 00:05:03.239
If I wasn't short of money
for cash flow,

00:05:03.508 --> 00:05:05.628
I would never waste an
Awakening Stone on him.

00:05:05.821 --> 00:05:07.966
Brat with privilege?
What does he mean?

00:05:09.107 --> 00:05:10.267
Come over here, boy.

00:05:10.587 --> 00:05:12.148
I will make this clear to you.

00:05:12.346 --> 00:05:15.584
What you awaken depends on your
fate and bloodline.

00:05:15.729 --> 00:05:17.062
Even if this is an
invigorated awakening,

00:05:17.274 --> 00:05:18.914
we would only increase the chance
of success for you.

00:05:19.459 --> 00:05:23.444
If you awaken some other Talents,
that will not be my fault.

00:05:23.772 --> 00:05:24.585
I know that.

00:05:24.825 --> 00:05:26.023
I want to awaken the Shadow Talent.

00:05:26.116 --> 00:05:27.942
Why you use an Invigorating Stone
for Thunder Talent?

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.370
Give him what he wants.

00:05:36.423 --> 00:05:39.463
Shadow Talent for your first awakening?
You must be joking.

00:05:58.402 --> 00:05:59.522
What is going on?

00:06:07.319 --> 00:06:10.492
Mysterious, treachery, danger.

00:06:11.155 --> 00:06:13.880
So this is the Shadow Talent?
Invigorate?

00:06:15.618 --> 00:06:16.635
I made it.

00:06:18.673 --> 00:06:21.119
In a place full of new experiences
like the university,

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.395
I certainly need something cool
like the Shadow Talent...

00:06:23.542 --> 00:06:26.172
to catch attention, to be popular...

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:29.105
and have the most beautiful lady
as my girlfriend!

00:06:31.308 --> 00:06:33.688
This feeling is so familiar.

00:06:35.952 --> 00:06:38.428
Oh my god!
There is a new energy signature!

00:06:38.866 --> 00:06:39.813
A fourth Talent!

00:06:39.939 --> 00:06:41.828
That's it, the fourth Talent!

00:06:43.085 --> 00:06:45.111
There is no colour on the Stardust.

00:06:45.409 --> 00:06:47.137
It's transparent.

00:06:47.789 --> 00:06:49.029
Are you done here?

00:06:49.109 --> 00:06:51.465
The other mages are
waiting outside. Don't...

00:06:52.608 --> 00:06:54.926
There is no colour on
the Talent you awakened?

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.195
The Summoning Talent!

00:06:57.525 --> 00:06:59.785
You awakened the Summoning Talent!

00:07:00.373 --> 00:07:01.093
Kid,

00:07:01.507 --> 00:07:04.168
the 100 thousand yuan you spent
is worth it after all.

00:07:04.994 --> 00:07:06.928
-This is great!
-All right.

00:07:07.149 --> 00:07:09.928
Get moving if you are done here.
I am busy.

00:07:10.292 --> 00:07:11.425
Thank you so much.

00:07:12.245 --> 00:07:14.952
Unless you work hard, this special
Talent will mean nothing to you.

00:07:15.307 --> 00:07:16.947
You are not very young yourself,

00:07:17.023 --> 00:07:18.986
you have a lot of catching up to do.

00:07:19.417 --> 00:07:20.897
This is nothing to be excited about.

00:07:21.087 --> 00:07:22.527
Am I old?

00:07:28.587 --> 00:07:31.640
You must be the Starchart mage
Tang Yue sent here.

00:07:32.163 --> 00:07:33.683
Mo Fan, his name is Mo Fan.

00:07:34.031 --> 00:07:35.316
Hurry up, Mian.

00:07:35.402 --> 00:07:36.210
Serve the tea.

00:07:36.439 --> 00:07:37.666
I am Yang Dahai.

00:07:37.972 --> 00:07:40.039
Mo Fan is the young man
that left just now.

00:07:40.978 --> 00:07:41.938
Master?

00:07:42.335 --> 00:07:44.175
Did we get the wrong man?

00:07:44.712 --> 00:07:47.383
So, he was awakening his second Talent?

00:07:47.886 --> 00:07:49.659
A Starchart mage at such a young age?

00:07:49.859 --> 00:07:51.753
And his second Talent is
the Summoning Talent?

00:07:51.964 --> 00:07:54.284
I, Guo Li Yu, was totally convinced.

00:07:54.837 --> 00:07:56.423
I am here to awaken my Thunder Talent.

00:07:57.154 --> 00:07:59.168
Mian, show him to the Awakening Room.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:02.542
Master, you just ordered me
to serve the tea.

00:08:02.622 --> 00:08:03.609
Forget about the tea.

00:08:04.888 --> 00:08:06.418
Did I say something wrong?

00:08:09.978 --> 00:08:11.546
Xinxia, I have a good news...

00:08:30.391 --> 00:08:31.617
Brother Mo Fan.

00:08:31.837 --> 00:08:35.230
Will I never ever walk
like a normal person?

00:08:35.445 --> 00:08:36.639
If your legs fail you,

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.407
I'll give you a pair of wings.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:45.590
Magical Gear.

00:08:46.521 --> 00:08:48.787
It was once a far-fetched dream for me.

00:08:49.335 --> 00:08:51.909
But now, I have four Talents with me.

00:08:52.211 --> 00:08:53.558
If I work hard enough,

00:08:53.695 --> 00:08:57.249
someday, I will give her a pair
of beautiful wings.

00:08:57.692 --> 00:08:59.120
Xinxia, just wait.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.436
Good, the tenth Stars is up next.

00:09:39.438 --> 00:09:41.100
Here it comes, good.

00:09:54.131 --> 00:09:55.158
Finally!

00:09:55.459 --> 00:09:58.043
I finally got a hang of
the Nebula Starchart.

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:04.340
Six month, then the Mingzhu Academy
will start its new admission.

00:10:05.707 --> 00:10:07.617
Good, again!

00:10:58.345 --> 00:11:00.239
Time flies indeed.

00:11:00.292 --> 00:11:03.293
We have been here for a year
and it felt like it was yesterday.

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:04.103
Dad,

00:11:04.422 --> 00:11:06.606
I have been focusing on meditation
for the past year.

00:11:06.845 --> 00:11:09.544
You had to take care of
the whole family, thank you.

00:11:10.975 --> 00:11:14.233
The two of you should
focus on your study.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.526
Tomorrow is your second chance
at the examination.

00:11:16.981 --> 00:11:19.368
I hope you get into a good
magical academy.

00:11:19.859 --> 00:11:21.499
With your Double Talents,

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:23.875
I bet all the prestigious universities
would like to take you in.

00:11:24.193 --> 00:11:25.963
I don't plan on telling them
about my Talents.

00:11:26.738 --> 00:11:28.178
How are you going to
pass the examination?

00:11:28.574 --> 00:11:30.960
Thousands of candidates are trying
to get into Mingzhu University.

00:11:31.405 --> 00:11:33.552
A Thunder Talent is barely
enough to impress anyone.

00:11:34.072 --> 00:11:36.182
If I use my Summoning Talent
as my main Talent,

00:11:36.511 --> 00:11:39.004
and my Stardust is in level 3,

00:11:39.445 --> 00:11:41.005
they can make an exception
for me and let me pass.

00:11:42.396 --> 00:11:45.901
Wait, when did you awaken
the Summoning Talent?

00:11:52.692 --> 00:11:55.280
After all the trainings,
I realized that it doesn't matter...

00:11:55.281 --> 00:11:57.894
no matter there is a lot of knowledge
to learn or magics to acquire,

00:11:58.336 --> 00:12:00.416
it will be a long journey.

00:12:01.212 --> 00:12:02.145
Which is why...

00:12:02.718 --> 00:12:03.518
University,

00:12:04.214 --> 00:12:06.107
here I come now!

00:12:12.475 --> 00:12:13.603
Summoning Talent?

00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:16.132
A gift is hard to obtain.

00:12:16.256 --> 00:12:19.563
You chose an interview instead of
the proper entrance test?

00:12:19.727 --> 00:12:23.127
Do you not have enough confidence
for your Talent?

00:12:24.836 --> 00:12:27.196
After all, the Summoning Talent
is your main Talent.

00:12:27.494 --> 00:12:29.840
He is born with the advantage.

00:12:30.558 --> 00:12:34.712
You passed the minimum requirement
for our Stardust Test.

00:12:34.987 --> 00:12:38.514
But you have never used
a Summoning spell before.

00:12:38.885 --> 00:12:40.751
It's hard for us to make a judgement.

00:12:41.271 --> 00:12:45.207
There are only a handful of candidates
with Summoning Talent.

00:12:45.514 --> 00:12:47.969
We might not have enough people
to fill a dorm room.

00:12:48.323 --> 00:12:49.403
Chancellor Xiao,

00:12:49.483 --> 00:12:52.714
we have a Earth Talent mage that
excels in many aspects.

00:12:52.861 --> 00:12:54.969
That mage is very skilful
at using Earth magic.

00:12:55.155 --> 00:12:57.871
The mage was able to
create a quicksand...

00:12:57.938 --> 00:12:59.964
and trap a Training Beast with it.

00:13:00.355 --> 00:13:03.034
In that case, only one
of the two students...

00:13:03.074 --> 00:13:04.759
can be admitted to our academy.

00:13:04.783 --> 00:13:06.810
Sir, I passed the minimum requirements,

00:13:06.898 --> 00:13:08.564
you can't replace me out of the sudden.

00:13:08.698 --> 00:13:10.399
Be patient, Mo Fan.

00:13:10.773 --> 00:13:11.773
How about this?

00:13:12.023 --> 00:13:15.329
If you are able to control the
seven Stars of Summoning Talent,

00:13:15.685 --> 00:13:18.619
let's see how your
first summoning goes...

00:13:18.632 --> 00:13:20.203
and that will decide your fate.

00:13:21.099 --> 00:13:24.733
-That sounds reasonable.
-You have one week to get ready.

00:13:24.778 --> 00:13:25.898
A week from now,

00:13:25.902 --> 00:13:28.942
the teacher from Summoning Faculty
will decide if you should be accepted.

00:13:32.304 --> 00:13:35.320
I spent the whole year training
on my basic skills.

00:13:35.857 --> 00:13:39.712
They want me to summon something?
What if I summon an abomination?

00:13:39.892 --> 00:13:41.385
It will have no place to go.

00:13:44.781 --> 00:13:46.355
Miss Tang Yue, how are you lately?

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.607
Don't hang up, I have important
questions for you.

00:13:56.039 --> 00:13:57.239
Sorry for the long wait.

00:13:57.628 --> 00:14:00.590
I just got here.
You look gorgeous today.

00:14:01.647 --> 00:14:02.681
Let's take a walk.

00:14:03.471 --> 00:14:05.457
The Summoning Talent can
be quite complicated.

00:14:05.497 --> 00:14:06.545
We'll take our time here.

00:14:07.902 --> 00:14:11.729
The Summoning Talent is the most
dynamic Talent of all.

00:14:12.326 --> 00:14:15.295
With great control, it makes
a mage invincible.

00:14:15.724 --> 00:14:19.235
Unless put to good use,
it's no different from walking a dog.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.177
Which is why I am in a hurry
to talk to you.

00:14:23.682 --> 00:14:26.989
Dimensional Summoning is full
of untold mysteries itself.

00:14:27.506 --> 00:14:29.426
After you used
the Dimensional Summoning,

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:33.662
your consciousness will go into
a place entirely different from ours.

00:14:34.395 --> 00:14:36.996
It's known as the Dimension
of Summoning Beast.

00:14:37.437 --> 00:14:41.376
Your consciousness will roam
around the dimension swiftly...

00:14:41.659 --> 00:14:43.379
and search for beast closest
to your proximity.

00:14:43.955 --> 00:14:45.088
Another dimension?

00:14:46.909 --> 00:14:48.533
Okay, there is no one here.

00:14:48.909 --> 00:14:49.629
We'll do it here.

00:14:50.067 --> 00:14:52.081
Miss, why are we here?

00:14:56.608 --> 00:14:58.815
Seriously? For real?

00:15:01.984 --> 00:15:03.251
This is such a nuisance.

00:15:03.367 --> 00:15:05.500
It takes too long to get
accepted by the university.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.128
Li, do you think there is anything
special about Summoning Talent?

00:15:09.195 --> 00:15:12.181
It's nothing special compared with you.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:14.700
We'll just see what that kid
is capable of.

00:15:14.701 --> 00:15:16.801
How dare he messes me.

00:15:16.865 --> 00:15:20.146
If they won't accept you,
we'll head to the Swallow City.

00:15:20.172 --> 00:15:22.060
After all, that is where we belong to.

00:15:22.087 --> 00:15:22.848
I am not going.

00:15:23.142 --> 00:15:25.662
I want to prove those
who looked down on me wrong!

00:15:25.754 --> 00:15:28.453
I can still come out on
top without my father!

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:32.208
Besides that, stepping on those
arrogant fools...

00:15:32.328 --> 00:15:34.497
could be very interesting.

00:15:35.394 --> 00:15:38.396
Fine, as long as you don't
get into trouble.

00:15:41.352 --> 00:15:43.049
Luo Song, have a seat here.

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:44.470
Brat,

00:15:44.523 --> 00:15:47.567
you refused to go to Swallow City and
want to fight a Summoning mage?

00:15:47.821 --> 00:15:51.233
Uncle Li, a Summoning mage
is nothing to be afraid of.

00:15:56.685 --> 00:15:59.020
There is no aiding
equipment that you need?

00:15:59.374 --> 00:16:00.791
They cost a fortune,
I can't afford those.

00:16:01.415 --> 00:16:03.079
Very well, let's begin.

00:16:03.826 --> 00:16:05.660
Choose another Talent
if you are broke.

00:16:06.551 --> 00:16:08.225
Look, he is starting.

00:16:15.749 --> 00:16:17.746
Miss Tang Yue,
that is too straight forward.

00:16:17.826 --> 00:16:19.076
I am not ready yet.

00:16:19.165 --> 00:16:20.031
What?

00:16:20.138 --> 00:16:22.518
I want you to try your
Dimensional Summoning here.

00:16:24.011 --> 00:16:26.636
-Okay, let's start.
-I'll control your pace.

00:16:26.703 --> 00:16:28.480
I'll help you if you
run into any trouble.

00:16:28.622 --> 00:16:31.039
In this world, a dimension
is not singular.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.709
The Dimension of Summoning Beast
is a smaller dimension that we know.

00:16:35.627 --> 00:16:36.694
More precisely speaking,

00:16:36.774 --> 00:16:39.759
that dimension is attached to our world.

00:16:56.573 --> 00:16:59.151
Your consciousness will roam inside
the Dimension of Summoning Beast.

00:16:59.354 --> 00:17:01.874
The creatures you encounter
will be different as well.

00:17:03.746 --> 00:17:06.332
Summon with the will
of a Starchart mage,

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:09.747
probably, you will be able
to summon more powerful beast.

00:17:10.445 --> 00:17:11.098
However,

00:17:11.763 --> 00:17:14.457
that depends on the
strength of your will.

00:17:21.663 --> 00:17:24.195
Remember, gain control
over it with your will.

00:17:38.428 --> 00:17:39.242
I choose you!

00:17:40.108 --> 00:17:43.912
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:17:43.913 --> 00:17:47.140
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:17:47.166 --> 00:17:50.144
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:17:50.157 --> 00:17:52.734
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:17:57.407 --> 00:17:59.662
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:17:59.663 --> 00:18:01.723
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:18:01.762 --> 00:18:03.877
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:18:03.912 --> 00:18:07.145
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:18:07.635 --> 00:18:10.818
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary ♪

00:18:10.819 --> 00:18:12.413
♪ For one to rise up and see? ♪

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:15.080
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:18:15.081 --> 00:18:17.358
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:18:17.379 --> 00:18:20.072
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:18:20.099 --> 00:18:23.404
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:18:24.142 --> 00:18:25.453
♪ The more I go against it ♪

00:18:25.497 --> 00:18:26.886
♪ The more certain I am ♪

00:18:26.887 --> 00:18:29.001
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:18:29.725 --> 00:18:30.895
♪ The wind blows ♪

00:18:30.896 --> 00:18:33.171
♪ I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:18:33.172 --> 00:18:34.104
♪ As we meet ♪

00:18:34.105 --> 00:18:36.210
♪ One time you fight the fear ♪

00:18:36.211 --> 00:18:37.711
♪ Fly to high ♪

00:18:37.747 --> 00:18:41.210
♪ Every drop of sweat remembers
how you have tried ♪

00:18:41.253 --> 00:18:43.004
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:18:43.005 --> 00:18:44.925
♪ Who realize all desires ♪

00:18:44.926 --> 00:18:47.106
♪ Until we start to fight ♪

00:18:47.127 --> 00:18:48.431
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:18:48.432 --> 00:18:51.779
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:54.709
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:58.176
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:18:58.712 --> 00:18:59.811
♪ Oh ♪

00:19:00.438 --> 00:19:04.080
♪ You're always standing by my side ♪
